repository-code: 'https://github.com/suhailrehman/fuzzydata'
url: 'https://github.com/suhailrehman/fuzzydata'
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  A scalable workload generator for testing dataframe workflow systems. Generates
  randomized data-transformation workflows with ground-truth lineage, per-edge
  provenance annotations and equivalence classes over mutually-derivable artifacts,
  for benchmarking dataframe systems and for building data-lineage inference corpora.
keywords:
  - data lineage
  - provenance
  - dataframes
  - benchmarking
  - synthetic data
